   "missing_information": "Which form and site is this for (site URL or site name and form name)? Are you using Wix Forms (new) or old Wix Forms? Is the automation trigger set to that specific form and is the trigger app Wix Forms (not Site Members)? Does the form include an Email field (is the field type set to Email) and is that field synced to your Contact List as Email or Email (Main)? Is the automation configured with \"Include trigger contact\" under Set Recipients, or are you sending to other recipients? When you tested, were you logged into your Wix account? Do you see the form submission in the form's submissions table? Do you have the recipient's email address and can you confirm it is valid?",
