   "answer": "Please answer these specific questions so we can follow the correct procedure: 1) Are your payouts handled by Wix Payments or by a third-party payment provider? (Procedures differ between Wix Payments verification and third-party payouts.) [1][4][5] 2) Are you managing payouts in a Wix Studio workspace (Payouts tab)? [5][2] 3) When exactly did you update your banking information? (We need the date to check the expected verification window\u2014Wix Payments notes: \"Allow 7 business days for the account to be verified.\" [1]) 4) Did you receive any verification emails from Wix or any error/decline messages from your bank or payment provider? If so, please copy the message or attach a screenshot. 5) Which country is your account registered in? (Verification document requirements can be country-specific, e.g., EIN/UTR/codice fiscale guidance.) [1][3] Once you provide these details we can: - If you use Wix Payments, check verification timing and required documents and advise next steps or escalate to Customer Care if verification exceeded the stated timeframe [1][3]. - If you use a third-party provider, advise contacting that provider for payouts and confirm the currency/payment method match, or guide you on switching providers if needed [4].",
